  "interpretation": "EFI_UNSUPPORTED, BusMasterRead, 1 byte, below 4 GiB, unchanged CR3. In current MapBuffer implementation these arguments exclude its direct range/common-buffer rejections. Remaining EFI_UNSUPPORTED comes from Allocate successfully choosing a page outside Owned arena and freeing it. This infers allocation rejection from source branches; the rejected bounce address itself was not captured.",
  "unresolved": "Why the child EFI memory map permitted that selection; whether fixing DMA allocation also resolves BlInitializeLibrary; no successful Windows boot confirmed.",
